OL,3,CStrikes by bus drivers in dispute
OL,4,Crelated to hot weather postponed
OL,6,FStrikes by more than 1,500 bus drivers
OL,7,Fin a dispute related to the hot
OL,8,Fweather have been postponed.
OL,10,FMembers of Unite working for Arriva
OL,11,FNorth London walked out on Friday and
OL,12,Fagain on Tuesday in protest about hot
OL,13,Fweather working.
OL,15,FFollowing talks between the two sides,
OL,16,Fstrikes planned to start on Wednesday
OL,17,Funtil Friday have been suspended to
OL,18,Fallow Unite members to be balloted on
OL,19,Fa new deal on conditions.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/3
