OL,3,CStrikes by bus drivers in dispute
OL,4,Crelated to hot weather postponed
OL,6,FUnite said if the offer is rejected,
OL,7,Fstrike action will resume on Tuesday
OL,8,FAugust 25.
OL,10,FUnite regional officer Steven
OL,11,FStockwell said: "Following talks,
OL,12,FArriva has made an offer to Unite
OL,13,Fmembers.
OL,15,F"To allow our members to have their
OL,16,Fsay on whether to accept this, we have
OL,17,Fpostponed strike action so they can be
OL,18,Fballoted."
